We are in the new flat.
I have a large suitcase.
It is very heavy.
I put the suitcase on the floor.
The suitcase is kept near the door.
Asha also comes inside.
My small bag is in her hand.
She puts the bag down.
Now the small bag is kept near the large suitcase.
Both bags are lying on the floor.
Asha smiles.
She says, "Maya, put your things away comfortably."
"There is no hurry."
I say, "Thank you, Asha."
My luggage is lying in the room.
There is a lot of peace in the room.
Now I live here.
